      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for clearing that up, that makes more sense. so if the escrow agent is holding my money in a segregated account, what exactly happens if one of the parties suddenly decides they don't want to go through with it anymore? like, how does that money actually get released?",
      "source": "evaluator"
